2.0.0 - 02-07-2026
-------------------
  - Restructured SHINE package into a modular sub-package architecture.
  - Added Find_Em_SHINE sub-package for the line-emitter extraction and cataloguing pipeline (extract, covariance, build_em_catalog).
  - Moved Make_Im_SHINE into its own sub-package for better modularity.
  - Simplified shine_utils.py to only contain clean_clube (general utility).
  - Updated documentation to reflect the new structure.

1.1.0 - 20-01-2025
-------------------
- New version fully adapted for 2D image extraction with new features.

1.0.0 - 10-12-2024
-------------------
- First public release.
